get.description:
The frontend passes a list of game slugs as a query parameter and
receives back all metrics aggregated across sessions for those games.

GET /scoring/api/game-metrics/?games=memory-master,puzzle-quest

Response shape:
{
    "games": ["memory-master", "puzzle-quest"],
    "session_count": 12,
    "total_play_time_seconds": 3600,
    "skills": {
        "attention": {"avg_score": 0.72, "min_score": 0.5, "max_score": 0.9, "sessions": 8},
        "memory":    {"avg_score": 0.65, ...},
        ...
    },
    "moods": {
        "focus":  {"avg_score": 0.8, "avg_confidence": 0.85, "sessions": 6},
        "relax":  {"avg_score": 0.6, ...},
        ...
    },
    "flow": {
        "avg_score": 0.75,
        "avg_confidence": 0.82
    }
}
